libnsfdb
------------------------------------------
libnsfdb is a library to access the Notes Storage Facility (NSF) database file
format.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbfio1-20260623-1bl1
  libcdata1-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libcfile1-20260704-1bl1
  libclocale1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libcpath1-20260703-1bl1
  libfcache1-20260520-1bl1
  libfdata1-20260521-1bl1
  libnsfdb-devel-20260526-1bl1
  libnsfdb1-20260526-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libbfio-devel-20260623-1bl1
  libcdata-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcfile-devel-20260704-1bl1
  libclocale-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcpath-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcsplit-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libfcache-devel-20260520-1bl1
  libfdata-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfdatetime-devel-20260521-1bl1
  libfvalue-devel-20260531-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libuna-devel-20260602-1bl2
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libnsfdb

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libnsfdb/archive/refs/tags/20260526.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libnsfdb-20260526-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libnsfdb-20260526-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libnsfdb-20260526-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnsfdb-20260526-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnsfdb1-20260526-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libnsfdb-devel-20260526-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libnsfdb)
  /usr/bin/nsfdbexport.exe
  /usr/bin/nsfdbinfo.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libnsfdb.README
  /usr/share/doc/libnsfdb/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libnsfdb/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libnsfdb/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libnsfdb/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libnsfdb/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/nsfdbinfo.1.gz

(libnsfdb1)
  /usr/bin/cygnsfdb-1.dll

(libnsfdb-devel)
  /usr/include/libnsfdb.h
  /usr/include/libnsfdb/codepage.h
  /usr/include/libnsfdb/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libnsfdb/error.h
  /usr/include/libnsfdb/extern.h
  /usr/include/libnsfdb/features.h
  /usr/include/libnsfdb/types.h
  /usr/lib/libnsfdb.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libnsfdb.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libnsfdb.3.gz

